==Strategy==
If the player owns [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], this stage becomes extremely easy as simply spamming it can win you the battle.

On higher levels or if one doesn't own Courier, using anti-red or black units such as [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]], or [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] can work just as well.

